# Live runtime order/PHI data — these diverge on the production server as real
# orders come in. Tracking them in git causes: (1) PHI sitting in git history,
# (2) production `git pull` conflicts/aborts whenever the live file has changed
# since last pull (this is what silently blocked the CTS deploy on 2026-07-23).
# Local working copies are kept — only removed from git tracking.
prism_nemt_data.json
prism_nemt_data.json.tmp
